{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018PifkTu5cixq3D8U8N3CYW","type":"tool_result","content":"# Farmers Markets in the U.S.\n\nBased on the data provided, I've calculated the total number of farmers markets across all 50 states and Washington, D.C.\n\n**Total U.S. Farmers Markets: 8,268**\n\nThis sum excludes the three territories listed in the dataset:\n- Puerto Rico (2 markets)\n- Virgin Islands (0 markets)\n- Hawaii is included as a state (13 markets)\n\nThe calculation aggregates the \"farmers_markets\" column for all 51 U.S. jurisdictions (50 states + DC), resulting in approximately 8,268 farmers markets operating throughout the country."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a476b21a-08a3-4832-9adf-ed88235e38df","uuid":"55487675-c507-4c51-8308-570de1b3d2ab","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:09:08.561Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Farmers Markets in the U.S.\n\nBased on the data provided, I've calculated the total number of farmers markets across all 50 states and Washington, D.C.\n\n**Total U.S. Farmers Markets: 8,268**\n\nThis sum excludes the three territories listed in the dataset:\n- Puerto Rico (2 markets)\n- Virgin Islands (0 markets)\n- Hawaii is included as a state (13 markets)\n\nThe calculation aggregates the \"farmers_markets\" column for all 51 U.S. jurisdictions (50 states + DC), resulting in approximately 8,268 farmers markets operating throughout the country.","durationMs":2191,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
